  "value": "30.3",
  "unit": "TB",
  "text": "NASA's open Physical Sciences Informatics bucket holds 30.3 TB in 388,602 files from just three ISS investigations; the PK-4 plasma lab alone recorded a median 702 GB of video per science day."
 },
