 "investigations": {
  "DSI": "DECLIC-DSI (CNES/NASA, ISS 2010-2011): directional solidification of a transparent succinonitrile-0.24 wt% camphor alloy, imaging the 3-D cellular/dendritic front in situ (PI R. Trivedi, Iowa State; Co-I A. Karma, Northeastern; NASA Task Book NNX07AK69G).",
  "OASIS": "OASIS (ISS 2015-2016): Observation and Analysis of Smectic Islands In Space - freely suspended liquid-crystal (smectic) bubbles, islands, coarsening, Marangoni and electric-field tests on 4 samples (PSI OASIS Data Organization Document).",
  "PK-4": "PK-4 (ESA/Roscosmos, ISS Columbus, 2014-2019 campaigns C00-C08): complex (dusty) plasma flowing in a DC discharge tube - on-board videos, sensor logs and ground data, curated for PSI by the University of Memphis team (PSI PK-4 summary document)."
